OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for robbing vulnerable
OL,4,Aman at knifepoint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who robbed a vulnerable man at
OL,7,Fknifepoint has been jailed for three
OL,8,Fand a half years.
OL,10,FRobert Laughland, 52, targeted David
OL,11,FMorland in Glasgow's Battlefield area
OL,12,Fat around midnight on 19 April.
OL,14,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard Morland was
OL,15,Fusing a walking stick when he was
OL,16,Fapproached by Laughland and another
OL,17,Fman.
OL,19,FSheriff Michael Hanlon told Laughland:
OL,20,F"This was an appalling crime committed
OL,21,Fon a vulnerable person."
